@startuml
title Koin Startup Sequence (Android & Desktop)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
actor "App Startup" as App
participant "Koin" as K
participant "coreModules\n(commonMain)" as Core
participant "uiSharedModules\n(commonMain)" as UIShared
participant "androidPlatformModules\n(androidMain)" as Android
participant "desktopPlatformModules\n(desktopMain)" as Desktop
== Android Startup ==
App -> K: startKoin([coreModules, uiSharedModules,
androidPlatformModules])
K -> Core: load coreModules
Core --> K: loaded
K -> UIShared: load uiSharedModules
UIShared --> K: loaded
K -> Android: load androidPlatformModules
Android --> K: platform services bound
K --> App: Android DI ready
== Desktop Startup ==
App -> K: startKoin([coreModules, uiSharedModules,
desktopPlatformModules])
K -> Core: load coreModules
Core --> K: loaded
K -> UIShared: load uiSharedModules
UIShared --> K: loaded
K -> Desktop: load desktopPlatformModules
Desktop --> K: platform services bound
K --> App: Desktop DI ready
@enduml
